<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Policy Administration Lifecycle</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            A robust core engine managing every interaction with the insurance contract, from 
            initial inception through years of renewals and structural modifications.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Contractual Integrity & Multi-Class Support</h2>
        <p>
            The Policy Administration module provides a centralized platform for managing all 
            product classes in a single system. Whether issuing specialized commercial 
            lines, high-volume motor policies, or complex marine cargo covers, the 
            system maintains the unique data attributes and rating logic required 
            for each. Every policy creation triggers the generation of professional, 
            branded PDF schedules and policy wordings, ensuring absolute contractual 
            clarity between the insurer and the client.
        </p>
        <p>
            Native support for both personal and commercial lines ensures that your 
            organizational focus can remain on growth while the system handles the 
            structural complexity of diverse insurance portfolios.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Mid-Term Adjustments & Endorsements</h2>
        <p>
            Manage the fluid nature of risk with a structured endorsement workflow. Process 
            mid-term adjustments—such as vehicle additions, sum-insured changes, or 
            address updates—with automated premium re-calculation and immediate 
            generation of endorsement schedules. The system maintains a perfect 
            historical version of the policy, allowing you to view exactly what 
            cover was in place at any specific historical timestamp, an essential 
            capability for accurate claims handling.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Renewals & Retention Management</h2>
        <p>
            Drive portfolio stability through automated renewal orchestration. The system 
            automatically flags policies approaching their expiration date, triggering 
            personalized renewal invitations and updated premium estimates. Managers 
            can review renewal performance across branches and brokers, identifying 
            lapse trends and deploying retention strategies before policies expire.
        </p>
        <p>
            Digital archival of all policy-related communications, signed proposal forms, 
            and inspection photos provides a complete, searchable document library for 
            every policyholder, eliminating paper files and accelerating information 
            recovery.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

